<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais ups China Light call warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais ups China Light call warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said it issued a further 67 million call warrants on shares of China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd. Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$31.86	  PREMIUM	10.28 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK$0.74	   GEARING	4.81X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     06.JAN.98	 BOARD LOT    5,000</p>
<p> LISTING	  HONG KONG	 PAY DATE     17.MAR.97</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE     HK$35.60	  LISTING DATE 19.MAR.97</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT     CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
